actor "Dewi" as DW
participant "Webhook\noutbound" as OUT

W -> API : POST /leads\n{name, email, source="Website form",\ncustom.jumlah_karyawan=640}
activate API
API -> API : validasi: nama + (email atau telepon) + source ✔
API -> DB : cek duplikat (email, telepon, organisasi)
DB --> API : tidak ada
API -> R : tentukan Owner\n(tidak ada user login)
R --> API : aturan 1 cocok → Queue "Inbound Web"
API -> DB : simpan Lead\nstatus New · Owner kosong · masuk 08:41
API --> W : 201 Created {lead_id}
API -> OUT : event lead.created
deactivate API

== 08:55 · Dua Sales mengklaim lead yang sama ==
RK -> DB : claim
DW -> DB : claim (sedikit lebih lambat)
DB --> RK : berhasil → Owner = Raka
DB --> DW : ditolak: lead sudah diambil
DB -> OUT : event lead.assigned
